 "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300566} {:answer/id #uuid "a9cb8b03-0892-5abc-894c-fd8f3ea0915c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300812}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186300566} :answer-field/id #uuid "91857d77-adc5-5d07-b88e-f2dabe47806e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301690}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "36e66381-e67c-58c9-901d-001e6d2f3331" :question/math-academy-id "q-32532" :question/problem "Given that \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$ has the LU decomposition $A=LU,$ then $L=$" :question/worked-solution "To find the matrices $L$ and $U,$ we reduce the matrix $A$ to row echelon form. Whilst doing this, we simultaneously write down the row operations applied to $A$ in terms of matrix multiplication using elementary matrices.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} & ⟺ & \\,\\overset{{E}_{1}}{\\overset{⏞}{\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}}}\\cdot A \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{1} & ⟺ & \\,\\overset{{E}_{2}}{\\overset{⏞}{\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}}}\\cdot {E}_{1}\\cdot A \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =U\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe reduced matrix is upper triangular, so it is our matrix $U.$ Now, since ${E}_{2}{E}_{1}A=U,$ we can invert ${E}_{2}$ and ${E}_{1}$ to arrive at the desired LU factorization:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{E}_{2}{E}_{1}A & =U \\\\ {E}_{1}A & ={E}_{2}^{-1}U \\\\ A & ={E}_{1}^{-1}{E}_{2}^{-1}U \\\\ A & ={\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}{\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}U \\\\ A & =(\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix})U \\\\ A & ={{\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}}_{⏟}}_{L}{{\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}}_{⏟}}_{U}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "79d727ae-2ed7-5a1a-bf76-f90f26abe612" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504739}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504733 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186403815 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ef9d2af-2241-5be9-9fa4-a8e93a74b58c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403817} {:answer/id #uuid "40956895-fd15-5548-bb48-c3389b38029e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403818} {:answer/id #uuid "7a0c39e5-8073-5dcf-994d-9e5a575fc526" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403819} {:answer/id #uuid "66df6fbd-34ea-5bc6-80a0-f363e4fe5e21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403820} {:answer/id #uuid "3d0496f0-a286-58c3-82dc-168d307fbe1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403821}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186403820} :answer-field/id #uuid "844b700b-f1e6-59c0-ad41-788e19bacce4" :answer-field/key